# The two GENERATED protocol views. reviewctl.sh writes LF and --verify compares
# byte for byte, so a checkout that rewrites them to CRLF makes the ledger look
# hand-edited on every Windows clone -- a false alarm about the one file whose
# whole purpose is to be trustworthy.
docs/internal/reviews/REVIEW_LEDGER.md text eol=lf
docs/project/OPEN-THREADS.md text eol=lf
